{"3827470": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Monsterhearts: Welcome to Drowned Lake", "steam_appid": 3827470, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There’s something sinister in the small town of Drowned Lake—and the murder of your best friend’s just the tip of the iceberg. In this queer horror narrative deck-builder based on the acclaimed <i><strong>Monsterhearts TTRPG</strong></i> by Avery Alder, you navigate the drama of your fellow high-schoolers, investigate the town’s dark secrets, and tap into your supernatural side. What horrifying truths will you uncover?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827470/extras/4f7dde4cf660160971237cd573c7934d.avif?t=1776365685\" alt=\"Monsterhearts: Welcome to Drowned Lake logo\" width=775 height=229 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Drowned Lake, a small mountain town where supernaturals live among unsuspecting humans and high-school drama draws you into dark places. It’s the 1990s, and you’re a sophomore student recovering from the murder of your closest friend.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAKE YOUR MOVE, THEN FACE THE CONSEQUENCES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to characters both familiar and unknown, in and out of school. Use action cards called Moves that come in different types—Hot, Cold, Dark, Volatile—to develop relationships or break them down. Uncover secrets, confront foes, and maybe find some love along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827470/extras/72f2e57e74e013fae5ada4c16a28ec47.poster.avif?t=1776365685\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827470/extras/72f2e57e74e013fae5ada4c16a28ec47.webm?t=1776365685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827470/extras/72f2e57e74e013fae5ada4c16a28ec47.mp4?t=1776365685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY THE HAND YOU’RE DEALT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use cards to sway the outcome of your Moves. Strings give you influence over others, while Conditions can be a thorn in the side. Strategically work your way through sticky moments—but be warned, Chance is always there to nudge your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827470/extras/0c9f35202228be6dd4d3b676205b8d21.poster.avif?t=1776365685\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827470/extras/0c9f35202228be6dd4d3b676205b8d21.webm?t=1776365685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827470/extras/0c9f35202228be6dd4d3b676205b8d21.mp4?t=1776365685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOUR DECK OF EXPERIENCES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn new cards from the consequences of your actions, whether they’re good or bad. Discover cards with intriguing effects and a range of exciting upgrades, and use these to steer your personal arc through the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827470/extras/0c9481927d18e5f973e48b78384ae442.poster.avif?t=1776365685\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827470/extras/0c9481927d18e5f973e48b78384ae442.webm?t=1776365685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827470/extras/0c9481927d18e5f973e48b78384ae442.mp4?t=1776365685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SOLVE THE MYSTERY…OR NOT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you try to find the truth behind your friend’s murder? Investigate your classmate’s esoteric rituals? Manipulate the upcoming student council elections to your benefit? Or will you strike out on a path entirely your own?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827470/extras/9fb2d1b681361dda3dcf9ac85ff83367.poster.avif?t=1776365685\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827470/extras/9fb2d1b681361dda3dcf9ac85ff83367.webm?t=1776365685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827470/extras/9fb2d1b681361dda3dcf9ac85ff83367.mp4?t=1776365685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EMBRACE THE <i>MONSTERHEARTS</i> SPIRIT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover iconic features from the acclaimed <i>Monsterhearts</i> tabletop game, part of the Powered by the Apocalypse system. From Strings to Moves to the Darkest Self, it’s all reimagined for a digital experience that stays true to the tabletop game’s spirit while taking them in intriguing new directions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827470/extras/f6201e334b35e3009be785ba03ac356e.poster.avif?t=1776365685\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827470/extras/f6201e334b35e3009be785ba03ac356e.webm?t=1776365685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827470/extras/f6201e334b35e3009be785ba03ac356e.mp4?t=1776365685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT THE DEVELOPER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ludic Lemur makes games that are radically playful. A queer women-led indie studio, we’re on a search for new play and new players. We believe that well-designed games help people grow, joyously improving lives and society. That’s why we make games that expand play to a new level of inclusivity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ludic Lemur’s first game was an experimental interactive audio narrative called <i>Calm the Storm</i>, which was nominated in the Achievements in Accessibility category at the Indie Game Awards in 2025. Our narrative paint-by-numbers game, Sun Catcher, will be released in the summer of 2026.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There’s something sinister in the small town of Drowned Lake—and the murder of your best friend’s just the tip of the iceberg. In this queer horror narrative deck-builder based on the acclaimed <i><strong>Monsterhearts TTRPG</strong></i> by Avery Alder, you navigate the drama of your fellow high-schoolers, investigate the town’s dark secrets, and tap into your supernatural side. What horrifying truths will you uncover?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827470/extras/4f7dde4cf660160971237cd573c7934d.avif?t=1776365685\" alt=\"Monsterhearts: Welcome to Drowned Lake logo\" width=775 height=229 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Drowned Lake, a small mountain town where supernaturals live among unsuspecting humans and high-school drama draws you into dark places. It’s the 1990s, and you’re a sophomore student recovering from the murder of your closest friend.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAKE YOUR MOVE, THEN FACE THE CONSEQUENCES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to characters both familiar and unknown, in and out of school. Use action cards called Moves that come in different types—Hot, Cold, Dark, Volatile—to develop relationships or break them down. Uncover secrets, confront foes, and maybe find some love along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827470/extras/72f2e57e74e013fae5ada4c16a28ec47.poster.avif?t=1776365685\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827470/extras/72f2e57e74e013fae5ada4c16a28ec47.webm?t=1776365685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827470/extras/72f2e57e74e013fae5ada4c16a28ec47.mp4?t=1776365685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY THE HAND YOU’RE DEALT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use cards to sway the outcome of your Moves. Strings give you influence over others, while Conditions can be a thorn in the side. Strategically work your way through sticky moments—but be warned, Chance is always there to nudge your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827470/extras/0c9f35202228be6dd4d3b676205b8d21.poster.avif?t=1776365685\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827470/extras/0c9f35202228be6dd4d3b676205b8d21.webm?t=1776365685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827470/extras/0c9f35202228be6dd4d3b676205b8d21.mp4?t=1776365685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOUR DECK OF EXPERIENCES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn new cards from the consequences of your actions, whether they’re good or bad. Discover cards with intriguing effects and a range of exciting upgrades, and use these to steer your personal arc through the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827470/extras/0c9481927d18e5f973e48b78384ae442.poster.avif?t=1776365685\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827470/extras/0c9481927d18e5f973e48b78384ae442.webm?t=1776365685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827470/extras/0c9481927d18e5f973e48b78384ae442.mp4?t=1776365685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SOLVE THE MYSTERY…OR NOT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you try to find the truth behind your friend’s murder? Investigate your classmate’s esoteric rituals? Manipulate the upcoming student council elections to your benefit? Or will you strike out on a path entirely your own?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827470/extras/9fb2d1b681361dda3dcf9ac85ff83367.poster.avif?t=1776365685\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827470/extras/9fb2d1b681361dda3dcf9ac85ff83367.webm?t=1776365685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827470/extras/9fb2d1b681361dda3dcf9ac85ff83367.mp4?t=1776365685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EMBRACE THE <i>MONSTERHEARTS</i> SPIRIT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover iconic features from the acclaimed <i>Monsterhearts</i> tabletop game, part of the Powered by the Apocalypse system. From Strings to Moves to the Darkest Self, it’s all reimagined for a digital experience that stays true to the tabletop game’s spirit while taking them in intriguing new directions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827470/extras/f6201e334b35e3009be785ba03ac356e.poster.avif?t=1776365685\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827470/extras/f6201e334b35e3009be785ba03ac356e.webm?t=1776365685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827470/extras/f6201e334b35e3009be785ba03ac356e.mp4?t=1776365685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT THE DEVELOPER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ludic Lemur makes games that are radically playful. A queer women-led indie studio, we’re on a search for new play and new players. We believe that well-designed games help people grow, joyously improving lives and society. That’s why we make games that expand play to a new level of inclusivity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ludic Lemur’s first game was an experimental interactive audio narrative called <i>Calm the Storm</i>, which was nominated in the Achievements in Accessibility category at the Indie Game Awards in 2025. Our narrative paint-by-numbers game, Sun Catcher, will be released in the summer of 2026.</p>", "short_description": "A queer horror narrative deckbuilder about the messy lives of teen monsters.", "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827470/daf2edb78733d11d63c577e4111146cc7fce8366/header.jpg?t=1776365685", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827470/0b1b4bce5103e15bb363da6c1fba7f4927968404/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776365685", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827470/0b1b4bce5103e15bb363da6c1fba7f4927968404/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1776365685", "website": "https://www.ludiclemur.com/monsterhearts", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x86_32 CPU with SSE2 support, x86_64 CPU with SSE4.2 support, ARMv8 CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics with full OpenGL 3.3 support<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> N/A</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "Monsterhearts: Welcome to Drowned Lake is based on the Monsterhearts tabletop roleplaying game, which is owned by Avery Alder of Buried Without Ceremony. Ludic Lemur Entertainment has a non-exclusive license to the setting and game systems.", "developers": ["Ludic Lemur Entertainment"], "publishers": ["Ludic Lemur Entertainment"], "demos": [{"appid": 4551340, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 64, "description": "Adjustable Text Size"}, {"id": 67, "description": "Camera Comfort"}, {"id": 66, "description": "Color Alternatives"}, {"id": 68, "description": "Custom Volume Controls"}, {"id": 75, "description": "Keyboard Only Option"}, {"id": 76, "description": "Mouse Only Option"}, {"id": 74, "description": "Playable without Timed Input"}, {"id": 79, "description": "Save Anytime"}, {"id": 65, "description": "Subtitle Options"}, {"id": 17, "description": "Includes level editor"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Fami